# FIX 2026-07-24: daily_universe.json and user_settings.json were listed
# above but still showed up as tracked (git ls-files) because they were
# committed to history before these ignore rules existed — .gitignore only
# stops NEW files from being added, it doesn't untrack files already in the
# index. Every time the live app wrote fresh runtime data to these files on
# EC2, "git pull --rebase" failed with "You have unstaged changes", silently
# blocking every deploy since. Untracked via `git rm --cached` in the same
# commit as this comment — see that commit message for the full incident.
ec2_log/
